## Why This Is Asked
Tests temporal reasoning with 3-valued Kleene logic and practical propagation.

## Key Concepts
- Temporal Kleene semantics with t+1 constraints
- Propagation and pruning to avoid F outcomes
- Concrete trace construction for feasibility validation

## Code Example
